{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1454621-do-antagonist-base-enhancement-and-enhancement-from-abilities-stack","id":1454621,"title":"Do antagonist base enhancement and enhancement from abilities stack?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-07-09T16:49:08-07:00","id":1454621,"title":"Do antagonist base enhancement and enhancement from abilities stack?","content":"Let's say an antagonist is an aberrant that has Quantum attack that gives them 3 enhancement if they spend a Quantum point. Judging by other NPCs they should also have a separate base enhancement stat. Let's give them an enhancement of 2.<br /> <br /> Would this then bump them up to an enhancement of 5? The base represents equipment and training and they have abilities on top of that? Or would it stay at 2. The enhancement is a summary of the powers for quick reference. In other words, Antagonists are asymmetrical and just roll with their base enhancement?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26906-jeffreybezos","name":"JeffreyBezos","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-10T04:04:29-07:00","id":1454648,"title":"","content":"My suggestion is stick to the enhancement listed and give scale if needed, according to your player characters and less about an static value.<br /> <br /> Most antagonists are not worth the time to detail that, and it\u2019s really easy to adapt on the fly during combat if needed.<br /> When you are talking about that last boss, that is another thing, and I suggest you take the dice pools and enhancements more as a suggestion than a hard rule. You can have one guy that is awesome in a single activity and sucks in absolutely every thing else, the pool would be 8 for primary action (with enhancements as needed) 4 as secondary and 2.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}